fields:
- key: profile
  type: text
  label: Browser profile
  description: Names the login bucket — the desktop app keeps a persistent session partition (`persist:collimate-<name>`)
    per name, so signing in once through the cell keeps that login across runs. Cells sharing this name
    share cookies and logins; a different name is a completely independent session, and two names can
    be signed in to the same site at the same time. "default" keeps your existing logins.
  default: default
  advanced: false
- key: device
  type: dropdown
  label: Device
  description: What each tab presents as. Phone and Tablet give the page that device's user agent and a mobile viewport
    of its width (412 and 800 pixels), letterboxed on the cell; Desktop is the desktop app's own browser. Each tab's
    toolbar can switch it while the run is live.
  options:
  - value: desktop
    label: Desktop
  - value: phone
    label: Phone
  - value: tablet
    label: Tablet
  default: desktop
  advanced: false
